# L §4.2 Date arithmetic moves a period by + or - only; a period times an int has no meaning: refused at load where
# the types show it (L §8.4, LOAD-UNIT).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "synthetic"

def g[m in months]: month = m * 1

ask q: g[2026-03]
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
